Host lab
    HostName 172.27.221.225
    User samyak_bardiya
    ServerAliveInterval 60
    ServerAliveCountMax 3
    TCPKeepAlive yes
    ForwardX11 yes
    ForwardX11Trusted yes
    ForwardAgent no
    Compression yes
    AddKeysToAgent yes
    StrictHostKeyChecking accept-new
    UserKnownHostsFile ~/.ssh/known_hosts
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/work-tp/id_ed25519_lab
    PubkeyAuthentication yes

    DynamicForward 1080                 # Tunnel SOCKS5 Proxy
    LocalForward 1234 localhost:1234    # FooBar
    LocalForward 6969 localhost:6969    # FooBar
    LocalForward 7777 localhost:7777    # FooBar
    LocalForward 8383 127.0.0.1:8384    # Syncthing

